menu "XiaoTai door application"

    config XIAOTAI_DOOR_TEMPLATES
        bool "The door's own pages for large colour displays"
        depends on XIAOTAI_UI_LVGL
        default y
        help
            Carries the door's own page templates, pictures, icons and fonts
            (about 1 MB of flash) for displays of 440 x 300 and more. Smaller
            displays show the door with the theme's ordinary pages; the build
            turns this off for a board whose first display is that small
            (scripts/sdk_selection.py). A product may set it either way in its
            "options".

endmenu
